---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Disclaimer" description="Assumption of risk and other terms that apply to products sold by RyFab Motorsports.">
  <main>
    <section class="section section--tight">
      <div class="container disclaimer-container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
          <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
        </div>
        <p class="mono disclaimer-updated">Last updated September 2026</p>

        <article class="prose">
          <h2>Assumption of risk</h2>
          <p>
            Products sold by RyFab Motorsports are aftermarket automotive fabrication parts
            intended for performance, motorsport, and off-road use. Installing and using these
            parts carries inherent risk, including the risk of part failure, vehicle damage,
            injury, or death. By purchasing, installing, or using any RyFab Motorsports product,
            you accept that risk and agree that you are solely responsible for verifying correct
            fit, installation, and use for your vehicle and application.
          </p>

          <h2>No warranty</h2>
          <p>
            Products are sold as-is, with no warranty of any kind, express or implied, including
            any warranty of merchantability or fitness for a particular purpose.
          </p>

          <h2>Installation and fitment</h2>
          <p>
            These parts are not installed by RyFab Motorsports. You are responsible for correct
            installation, including using proper hardware, torque specifications, and ongoing
            inspection. If you are not confident installing a part correctly, have it installed
            by a qualified professional before use.
          </p>

          <h2>Intended use</h2>
          <p>
            Parts are designed for motorsport, track, and off-road applications. Some parts may
            not be legal for use on public roads in your jurisdiction. It is your responsibility
            to confirm compliance with local laws and the rules of any event or sanctioning body
            before use.
          </p>

          <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the fullest extent permitted by law, RyFab Motorsports is not liable for any
            injury, death, or property damage arising from the purchase, installation, or use of
            its products, including damage arising from defects, improper installation, or use
            outside the intended application.
          </p>

          <h2>Questions</h2>
          <p>
            If something doesn't fit, doesn't look right, or you're not sure how to install it, <a href="/contact/">contact us</a> before using the part.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .disclaimer-container { max-width: 720px; }
  .disclaimer-updated { color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: var(--space-2); }
  .disclaimer-container .prose { margin-top: var(--space-8); }
</style>
